Investec on Alkem Labs
Upgrade to Buy, TP Rs 6400

Upgrade on
a) inexpensive valuations @24xFY28E vs India-focused peers at 38x;
b) underperformance in last 6M by >20% vs Nifty Pharma primarily led by CEO moving out;
c) While new CEO hunt is on, 1QFY27 was robust (11% sales growth, EBITDA @ 20.5%) – FY27 guide intact despite cost pressures;
d) are enthused by India gr guide of double digit growth (last few years have been 6-9%);
e) Other businesses should do well too: mid-to-high single-digit US gr, healthy double-digit ROW growth and CDMO biz to break even.

GPM increase was strong
(250bps+ both YoY, QoQ) and lends scope for beating EBITDAM guide.
